          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan Musani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini yayu Bezaleli, ilma Uri, akhaakhu Huri, ka gosa Yuda, fohad'e ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jabeenna kiyyaani guute. Ammalle anini yayu hubachafi ogumafi qalbi waan harkaani mid'aasanile kenneefi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka inni dandae waan heddu herege, worqifi qarsi sibiila diimani mid'aasu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammalle aka inni d'akha ch'ululuqa ch'ire faaya mid'aasu, aka mukha boch'e ammalle oguma aka heddu ta woini tolchani beekhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle anini yayu Oholiabu, ilma Ahisamaki, ka gosa Dani, fohad'e wahela tolcheefi. Ammalle anini yayu ogeeyi d'ibile qalbi oguma guddo kenneefi, aka worri dandae waan anini, Mid'aasa jed'e ch'ufa mid'aasu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaro Woyyuma, Sanduqa Wold'aqisatiifi qadaada isaa, miha Waaro suni ch'ufa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mesafi miha isaa woliini, waan ifseeni ira ejitu, ka worqi ch'allaani mid'aasanifi miha isiile ch'ufa, waan mesa fakaata ka hit'aana irati aarsani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan mesa fakaata ka sorio irati gubanifi miha isaale, qori guddo bisaani iti d'iqatanifi waan isiini ira ejitule; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "woya mimid'aadu Harunifi ilmaani isaa hojja huji qaallu hojattu keeyatanifi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "d'ad'a muudatiifi waan urgooftu ta fulla qulqullo mid'aasanile. Hojja worri waan kana ch'ufa mid'aasu, ha akuma anini siti hime kaani gula mid'aasu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
